{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-32a16f7ed7dc985c7d64","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","text":"사장님, 안녕구리!","speaker":"사자구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"사자구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4006975765397804063"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14648750605620941551"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-3ea05fe51e3c0ef271b7","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","text":"헤헤, 우리 역시 다시 만났네, 사장님!","speaker":"사자구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"사자구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6104759599959380655"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14648750605620941551"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-e9a98766106a2db3f75c","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","text":"왜 행운의 고양이로 변한 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"사자구리","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["11439187208003777136"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-fc3b0def71dbf2554e21","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","text":"이건 행운의 고양이가 아니라구리…. 사장님, 이건 분명히 문지기 사자잖아!","speaker":"사자구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"사자구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6289068682033620929"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14648750605620941551"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-1fb5d4ad2985b808cda0","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"s5a6e66b7712903ae","text":"양쪽에 하나씩 있는 게 국룰이야——사원증만 잘 숨기면 아무도 눈치채지 못할 거라구리","speaker":"사자구리","mission":"변신의 달인 너구리","scene":"사자구리","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15065142815457369317"],"speakerHashCandidates":["14648750605620941551"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-995fbd9610f090df41e8","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150